            "review_title": "Review at My Quang Ech Bep Trang",
            "review_text": "Tony Le\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam753 contributions\n0\nYou will regret it if you only believe in advertising\nFeb 2020\nfrog Quang's noodles of Kitchen's Trang ,\n- This restaurant is quite famous with tourists as well as localities. The space is elegant, spacious and cool (air-conditioner).\n- Frog Quang's noodles are typical of the restaurant, the food as well as the product presentation are very eye-catching and unique. However, it is not only frogs but also chickens, fish, eels, eggs .... it is a mix.\n- Service time is relatively long, the staff looks unfriendly.\n- Price is relatively high, taste is not very harmonious (myself). Anyway, I tried it to know but not sure to come back probably.\nThe plus point is the pretty good spring rolls (beef rolls).\n- A pity because the feeling of actual experience is different from the ad.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten July 14, 2020",
