            "review_text": "whitelight42\nMelbourne, Australia19 contributions\n0\nTourists watch out!\nFeb 2020\nI ordered one dish, then they brought a sesami cracker and something wrapped in leaves. I thought they were set of my order. However when I asked for the payment, they did additional payment and also they said that even they had no change. So i had to pay 30,000VD on top of my original order. It's not much, but I've never had that experience from other restaurants. Don't go!\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 12, 2020",
