            "review_title": "Review at My Quang Ech Bep Trang",
            "review_text": "Mikey Mike\nCanberra, Australia336 contributions\n0\nAverage food and bad service\nJun 2019\nMy wife and myself was at this place for dinner and have to admit. It’s average food and expensive for the price. Service is horrible as we place 3 dishes, received 2 within 40 minutes and found that they ran out of noodles. What is worse is they did not inform us and other customers but still welcoming new customers. \n\nThis is the worse place I had in any of the countries that I ever been too.\nWritten June 10, 2019",
