            "review_title": "Review at My Quang Ech Bep Trang",
            "review_text": "HS T\nZermatt, Switzerland114 contributions\n0\nTourist trap, expensive, bad service\nApr 2019 • Family\nWe made a huge mistake coming here, my friends living in Da Nang were all shocked when I told them how much I paid for the frog my quang I had here, it’s 4 TIMES more expensive than a typical local my quang. This place is only for tourists who don’t know the pricing and the food quality wasn’t even good. If you want great authentic my quang, do not go here, choose the place where there’s a lot of locals. We should have realized when we only saw foreigners there.\n\nThere were at least 6 Items on the menu that was NOT AVAILABLE that night. Even WATER. Can you believe it? They ran out of water to serve as drink, so we had to order these fancy expensive corn milk instead. The waiters looked so clueless, they don’t know what they’re doing, you have to always ask them for things cuz they forgot to bring you. I feel like the owner really just hired all these pretty girls for standing around, not for serving food. It was so disappointing.\n\njust don’t come here if you don’t want to have a bad expensive dinner\nRead more\nWritten May 21, 2019",
